    {
      "sample_index": 2,
      "text": "To graph the quantity of online gamers as a function of time, we would do the following:\n\\[ t \\]\n\\[ ____ \\]\n\\[ _______ \\]\n\\[ ________ \\]\n\\[ ___________ \\]\n\\[ ____________ \\]\n\\[ ______ \\]\n\\[……... \\]\nWhat is missing in the table above is:\n(A) \"A field that is perpendicular to the x-axis.\"\n(B) \"An arrow pointing in the direction of motion of the x-axis.\"\n(C) \"The y-coordinate of the end point of the arrow.\"\n(D) \"The quantity plotted on the y-axis.\"\n(E) \"The quantity plotted on the x-axis.\"\n\nWhat is the next term in the sequence below?\n\\(46, 3x2, 6x1, 13x5, 8x4, ...\\)\nA. \\(7x2\\)\nB. \\(10x4\\)\nC. \\(19x5\\)\nD. \\(72x3\\)\nE. \\(13x7\\)\nF. \\(\\ldots \\) There may be several correct answers.\n\nTo graph the quantity of online gamers as a function of time, the following information must be provided:\n\n- The time value (t)\n- The number of online gamers (y-axis)\n- Points on the function: (0,0), (1,46) (2,32) , (3,6X) , (4,13X) (5,8X) (6,X)\n\nThe y-coordinate of the end point of the arrow will depict the quantity plotted on the y-axis. It may be found at the bottom of the graph.\n\nThe correct answer shall be (C) \"The y-coordinate of the end point of the arrow.\"\n\nThe next term in the sequence below is:\n\nA. \\(7x2\\)\nB. \\(10x4\\)\nC. \\(19x5\\)\nD. \\(72x3\\)\nE. \\(13x7\\)\nF. \\(\\ldots \\) There may be several correct answers.\n\nThe answer is D.",
